I'm trying to compile nethack 3.0 pl19 on my 286 SCO Xenix system.  I'm
setup as Sysunix, SYSV, etc, with the 286 Xenix options in the src makefile.

Everything compiles great, and the game is playable.  But the special levels
compiled by lev_comp have a problem.  lev_comp produces no levels not error
messages.  Saying 'lev_comp tower.des' does not produce the tower[123] files
and lev_comp does not print any error messages.  Piping in tower.des to
lev_comp has the same effect.

Has anyone seen this behavior?  I'm going to get the level files from elsewhere,
but would like to see this working.

